{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14433","headline":"广陵送赵主簿自蜀归绦州宁觐 · 戴叔伦","name":"广陵送赵主簿自蜀归绦州宁觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将归汾水上，远省锦城来。\n已泛西江尽，仍随北鴈回。\n暮云征马速，晓月故关开。\n渐向庭闱近，留君醉一杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}